# TC-006: Mass-specific versus molar heat capacities of two metals
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 Cu 1g @ 25C
new
add v2 Fe 1g @ 25C
new
add v3 Cu 0.01mol @ 25C
new
add v4 Fe 0.01mol @ 25C
heat v1 10J
heat v2 10J
heat v3 10J
heat v4 10J
measure v1 thermometer
measure v2 thermometer
measure v3 thermometer
measure v4 thermometer
inspect
